⭐ Interaction Model

The Blueprint Panel supports:

Click → Highlight

Clicking a blueprint block highlights the corresponding region in the viewport.

Hover → Tooltip

Hovering over a line of code shows:

which fields it affects

which organisms it spawns

which meta‑equation parameters it sets

Sync with Playback

As the video plays:

the active model is highlighted

the active organism definition is highlighted

the meta‑equation block pulses when triggered

Search

Search by:

field name

model name

organism ID

parameter

This makes the panel a debugger for your universe.

